.SH BUGS
The rate out is reached by averaging (the samples at its edges shared),
not by a proper resampler: a rate out that does not divide the rate
filtered to (48k) keeps the tone clean to about 50 dB, not 70.
.PP
Wide FM is mono: the stereo subcarrier is filtered out, not decoded.
